# Version Synchronization Plan

## Files to Update When Changing Versions

When bumping the Cloud Burst version (currently 0.7.0), update the following files:

1. `package.json`: Update the "version" field
2. `CHANGELOG.md`: Add a new version section with changes
3. `next.config.js`: Update any version-specific configurations
4. `src/app/layout.tsx`: Update metadata version
5. `docs/development/STATUS_NOTES.md`: Update current version
6. `docs/development/VERSION_CONTROL.md`: Update current phase if needed
7. `docs/planning/roadmap.md`: Update progress indicators

## Automation

Consider implementing a version bump script that:
- Takes a new version number as input
- Updates all necessary files
- Creates a commit with the version bump
- Creates a git tag

## Version Display

Ensure the version is visible in:
- Footer of the application
- About page
- API responses (x-app-version header)
- Console logs during startup 